      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked bug",
      "value": "Thank you for the report!\n\nWe're aware of this bug, and offer some solutions in our FAQ, such as disabling Windows's path length limit, or choosing a path closer to the root of your hard drive. https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/guides/faq#why-is-my-project-missing-packages-or-why-cant-i-create-a-backup\n\nWe're looking into a solution for future versions of the VCC. Sorry for the inconvenience!",
