  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Backup fails if the path is longer than about 259 characters. There is also no info about what went wrong, just \"Could not make backup\". The program also doesn't delete the incomplete backup file.\n\nLog from a test that I did.\n\n2022-12-29 01:19:23.891 +02:00 [ERR] Could not make backup of C:\\Users\\ville\\Projects\\VRChatSDK\\VRChat Unity Projects\\Yeet because: Could not find a part of the path \"C:\\Users\\ville\\Projects\\VRChatSDK\\VRChat Unity Projects\\Yeet\\Assets\\TestPath test test test test test test test test\\another test test test test test folder\\TESTT\\even more testing\\extremely fancy document that is very useless as it is very much empty.txt.meta\"",
